          "summary": "十二条硬约束：创建流程、角色、工作目录、代码与知识来源、资产与 1006、任务闭环、时间口径、凭据、监督契约、验收。"
        },
        {
          "id": "agent-template.profile",
          "kind": "entry",
          "title": "Agent Profile v1 结构定义",
          "status": "available",
          "version": "1.0.1",
          "roles": [
            "external-reader",
            "coordinator",
            "knowledge-curator"
          ],
          "requires": [
            "agent-template.manifest"
          ],
          "oss": "noahsark/agent-template/v1.0.1/agent-profile.v1.json",
          "local": "templates/agents/agent-profile.v1.json",
          "summary": "机器可校验的 Profile 字段定义（instructions、description、并发、角色、目录等）。"
        },
        {
          "id": "agent-template.verifier",
          "kind": "entry",
          "title": "模板自检脚本",
          "status": "available",
          "version": "1.0.1",
          "roles": [
            "coordinator",
            "node-executor",
            "knowledge-curator"
          ],
          "requires": [
            "agent-template.manifest"
          ],
          "oss": "noahsark/agent-template/v1.0.1/verify-template.py",
          "local": "templates/agents/verify-template.py",
          "summary": "零依赖自检：校验 Profile 结构、必填字段、目录规则与禁用项，退出码非零即不合规。"
        }
      ]
    },
